<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy — AI Crossword Maker" description="Privacy policy placeholder aligned to actual product behavior." canonicalPath="/privacy/">
  <section class="container section prose" style="padding-top:1.5rem;">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p><em>Draft for development — replace with counsel-reviewed text before production.</em></p>
    <p>Local drafts stay in your browser IndexedDB until you sign in and migrate. API keys never ship to the browser. Production logs should not store full word lists, clues, or email bodies by default. AI providers may process prompt content under their terms; we set <code>store: false</code> where supported and do not claim zero retention across the whole vendor chain.</p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
